The .elemod files this repository releases are built from MIT-licensed
code: sambanks/octabam's modules, and the code those modules carry from
timhastie/octatrick-modules and markandrus/octemu. Each copyright holder's
notice and the MIT permission notice follow, as their repositories give
them. This repository's own text (README.md, convert.sh) is under the same
MIT terms, Copyright (c) 2026 irpina.

None of it is Elektron's: no file here contains Elektron firmware. Each mod
patches your own copy of the official Octatrack OS when you build. Octatrack
and Elektron are trademarks of Elektron Music Machines MAV AB, used only to
name the hardware these mods are for. Nothing here is made, endorsed or
supported by Elektron, or by the authors of the code it is built from.


